      "text": "To edit an IdP attribute object:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Private Access > VPN (for Legacy Apps) > VPN Access Policy IdP Address.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          76
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the IdP attribute object you want to edit, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          64,
          68
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Edit IdP Attribute Object page, modify fields as necessary. For more information about each field, see Configuring IdP Attribute Objects.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          32
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
